      "text": {
        "jp": "そんなわけないか。\r\nあんなちゃらい奴が反乱軍なんて。",
        "official_en": "If what he’s rebelling against is my faith in human decency, then sure.",
        "real_en": "No, that can't be right. A guy that frivolous couldn't possibly be a rebel."
